        "Description": "Combining contracts for a larger windfall, 47? Your targets Hannah Mathew and Maxwell Power have had their respective spouses contract their own to finally open themselves up to each other. Love is a deadly affair. Shamoon has ran the economics of the operations of Kong for years, so they both are our main targets, however, it is expected that she lays low at parties and events. Mendola, must be taken out of the picture for knowing too much, however, it is a bonus if you can gather his tablet.",
